 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TIEQlqnvBhoQ7kNvwFKxxVR&_nc_oc=AdpuShgeHdngytoGh4TuPWAKX6_U2paDxBK4yKBd1b5AOrHyKHz1oPUlY5PiCUOWv6I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGD2HBI5npbFnhEgRbVpWAtC5bjCC_0MzB9s1g2FJuxRQ&oe=6A7EF981"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=53H6vJ3aJq0Q7kNvwGaX3TC&_nc_oc=AdpFVUqpSINgGEQhiL6d10qKRPNsmkl6VJ-ee7af105EMvSAargaWoI2JfjuCExz11s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFP4DjGpbWTuifIDTfQYxXPTzQtYTuKjxfXJJY43SCN3w&oe=6A7F06E6"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=S4XszIEd-IMQ7kNvwGa_pCS&_nc_oc=Ado6fUK5Ttdy1OkZShmKtzJuZDc-OrDIWdWnck2mZlHvo5veXmbQyd_p1vaYqbV3TKU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGfQDiA2ZIM13IKMXayJ4CHtievdgdsPVcpTvKhXKtmzA&oe=6A7F10DC"}, {"fil